@startuml KTOB_12_sequence_export
title KTOB — Private Data Export
actor Reader
participant "Angular UI" as UI
participant "Java API" as API
participant "Identity guard" as Guard
participant "Export module" as Export
database "Supabase Postgres" as DB
Reader -> UI : Export my reading history
UI -> API : Request export (R1 essential data)
API -> Guard : verify token and readerId
alt Authorized
 Guard --> API : confirmed owner
 API -> Export : prepare reader-only archive
 Export -> DB : get owned library entries
 Export -> DB : get reading experiences, journal, collections
 Export -> DB : get permitted preference records
 DB --> Export : reader-scoped records
 Export --> API : portable readable/structured export
 API --> UI : downloadable export
 UI --> Reader : save personal copy
else Invalid credentials
 Guard --> API : reject
 API --> UI : unauthorized
end
note over Export,DB
R1: essential library, journal, ratings, collections, preferences.
Complete conversation + acquisition archive is R2.
No other reader's data may appear.
end note
@enduml
